{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50229","headline":"及第後读书院咏物[一]十首上礼部李侍郎 药臼[一] · 樊铸","name":"及第後读书院咏物[一]十首上礼部李侍郎 药臼[一]","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"器重性仍坚，登庸响即传。\n口因良药苦，心爲中规圆。\n继务精三代，轮攻孕十全。\n终齐善救理，莫谓枉陶甄。\n（[一]刘云：「『臼』与『救』同，声爲上去，故可作音源。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"樊铸","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50229.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50229","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}